'''Description:''' Clerics who take the Trickery domain gain bonuses to Rogue-like skills and gain access to various invisibility spells.[[Image:Id trickery.gif|right|Trickery]]
== Domain special abilities ==

Divine trickery - Bonus to [[hide]], [[persuade]], [[search]], [[disable trap]], [[move silently]], [[open lock]], and [[pick pocket]] checks equal to 1 per 2 [[class level|cleric levels]]. This effect lasts for 5 [[turn]]s + the [[cleric]]'s [[charisma]] [[modifier]].

== Bonus spells ==
* Level 2 [[invisibility (spell)|invisibility]]
* Level 3 [[invisibility sphere]]
* Level 5 [[improved invisibility]]

== Notes ==

* ''Divine trickery'' can be used once per [[day]].
* The bonus is actually 1 higher than indicated by the description. (That is 1 + 1 per 2 levels.)

